        "locator": {
          "block_index": 1,
          "component_id": "0b1914f9-14ee-545a-ad1b-590c0c3c6959",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 726,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.020:block:1",
          "start": 335
        },
        "quote": "(b) For purposes of this section, a parking lot is closed to the public during specified hours if notice of same is prominently posted at every entrance to the parking lot in a manner likely to come to the attention of motorists entering or attempting to enter the parking lot. Permanently lettered, clearly legible signs bearing the following legend shall be deemed to be sufficient notice:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.020:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 10.60.020 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "34e19909-e6fe-575d-ac70-028c96fa7229",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 863,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.020:block:2",
          "start": 727
        },
        "quote": "THIS LOT IS CLOSED TO THE PUBLIC BETWEEN THE HOURS OF ________ AND ________. ORDINANCES OF THE CITY OF TOPEKA ENFORCED ON THIS PROPERTY.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.020:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 10.60.020 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "8daba386-7c20-58d4-8c91-5a518ad31243",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1058,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.020:block:3",
          "start": 864
        },
        "quote": "(c) It shall be a defense to a violation of this section if the person charged had actual authority to be upon the parking lot during the posted hours. (Code 1981 § 43-360. Code 1995 § 142-302.)",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.020:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
